  "details": "Forking this feature request link, as i agree with it, we need better shaders available to us on quest, as of the quest 3, we can handle a lot of performance heavy shaders. VRChat Devs, i think its time for a sdk update dont you think? If you do think it is, i thank you for listening, as a lot of people miss the ability to have what pc has. We currently have No sounds, and no custom shaders, this limits what we as creators can do.\n\nIf you're a reader, of this article please dont hesitate to upvote this to let the devs know we NEED this to happen.\n\nOriginal link i found about this:\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/custom-shaders-on-quest",
